  "problem": "Consider a sample of size $n=81$ from a population. Given that the sample mean is $12,$ and the sample standard deviation is $5,$ find a $90%$ confidence interval for the population mean $\\mu $ of the distribution.\n\n*Hint: Use the fact that $P(T>1.664)=0.05,$ where $T$ has a student's $t$-distribution with $80$ degrees of freedom.*",
